<title>USA: Noranda cuts U.S. aluminum prices in Oct.</title>
<headline>Noranda cuts U.S. aluminum prices in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Noranda Aluminum Inc said it cut its October U.S. list prices for aluminum ingot and billet to 72 cents per pound, and 82 cents per pound respectively, both down three cents from September levels.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities 212-859-1646</p>
</text>
